{
  "id": "Lyo.Compression.Lz4",
  "name": "Lyo.Compression.Lz4",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "`Lyo.Compression` addon that registers an `LZ4` `ICompressorFactory` using `EasyCompressor.LZ4`.",
  "description": "`Lyo.Compression` addon that registers an `LZ4` `ICompressorFactory` using `EasyCompressor.LZ4`.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Add the factory in DI",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "using Lyo.Compression;\nusing Lyo.Compression.Lz4;\nusing Lyo.Compression.Models;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n\nservices.AddLz4Compressor();\n\n// Configure via lambda\nservices.AddCompressionService(options =>\n{\n    options.DefaultAlgorithm = Lz4CompressionAlgorithm.Instance;\n    options.DefaultCompressionLevel = CompressionLevel.Fastest;\n});\nservices.AddDefaultCompressionService<CompressionService>();\n\n// Or bind from appsettings (CompressionOptions section)\nservices.AddLz4Compressor();\nservices.AddCompressionServiceFromConfiguration(configuration, CompressionServiceOptions.SectionName);\nservices.AddDefaultCompressionService<CompressionService>();"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "DI registration",
      "text": "AddLz4Compressor() registers the factory and nothing else. AddCompressionService, AddDefaultCompressionService<CompressionService>(), and keyed registration live in [`Lyo.Compression`](../Lyo.Compression/README.md). If stored files might carry CompressionAlgorithm = LZ4, register this factory so file-storage reads can open them. [ICompressionResolver](../Lyo.Compression/README.md#icompressionresolver-per-algorithm-dispatch) picks the codec from metadata in GetFileAsync / GetFileStreamAsync."
    }
  ],
